          <!-- Tab Content -->
          <div class="tab-content">

            <div class="tab-pane fade show active" id="Investment">

              <p class="fst-italic">Our seasoned fund managers work diligently to optimize your investments, driving consistent growth while minimizing risks.
                We handle the complexities of the market so you can achieve your financial goals with peace of mind.</p>

              <div class="d-flex align-items-center mt-4">
                <i class="bi bi-check2"></i>
                <h4>Expert Fund Management</h4>
              </div>
              <p>Our experienced team of fund managers uses proven strategies to maximize returns while mitigating risk. We work closely with you to develop personalized investment plans tailored to your financial goals.</p>

              <div class="d-flex align-items-center mt-4">
                <i class="bi bi-check2"></i>
                <h4>Diversified Investment Portfolios</h4>
              </div>
              <p>We manage diversified portfolios across a wide range of industries and asset classes. This approach helps spread risk and capture opportunities in different sectors, ensuring steady growth.</p>

              <div class="d-flex align-items-center mt-4">
                <i class="bi bi-check2"></i>
                <h4>Long-Term Growth Focus</h4>
              </div>
              <p>We prioritize long-term, sustainable growth over short-term gains. By investing with patience and discipline, we aim to build your wealth steadily, securing your financial future.</p>

              <div class="d-flex align-items-center mt-4">
                <i class="bi bi-check2"></i>
                <h4>Risk Management Strategies</h4>
              </div>
              <p>Our sophisticated risk management strategies are designed to protect your capital in volatile market conditions. We constantly monitor and adjust portfolios to keep your investments secure and profitable.</p>

              <div class="d-flex align-items-center mt-4">
                <i class="bi bi-check2"></i>
                <h4>Transparent and Personalized Service</h4>
              </div>
              <p> We believe in transparency and keep you informed every step of the way. Our personalized service ensures you understand your investments and feel confident in your financial journey.</p>

            </div>

            <div class="tab-pane fade" id="Trading">

              <p class="fst-italic">Our seasoned fund managers work diligently to optimize your investments, driving consistent growth while minimizing risks.
                We handle the complexities of the market so you can achieve your financial goals with peace of mind.</p>

              <div class="d-flex align-items-center mt-4">
                <i class="bi bi-check2"></i>
                <h4>Informed Market Insights</h4>
              </div>
              <p>Our team provides timely and accurate market analysis to Perform trading decisions. With expert insights, We navigate the complexities of the market and seize profitable opportunities.</p>

              <div class="d-flex align-items-center mt-4">
                <i class="bi bi-check2"></i>
                <h4>Tailored Trading Strategies</h4>
              </div>
              <p>We develop personalized trading strategies that align with your investment goals and risk tolerance. This customized approach ensures we have a clear plan that adapts to market conditions.</p>

              <div class="d-flex align-items-center mt-4">
                <i class="bi bi-check2"></i>
                <h4>Advanced Trading Techniques</h4>
              </div>
              <p>Utilizing sophisticated trading techniques and tools, we aim to maximize your returns. Our experts employ various strategies, from technical analysis to trend-following, to enhance returns on your investment.
              </p>

              <div class="d-flex align-items-center mt-4">
                <i class="bi bi-check2"></i>
                <h4>Continuous Monitoring and Support</h4>
              </div>
              <p>We continuously monitor market trends and your investments, providing you with real-time updates and support. Our dedicated team is always available to assist you.</p>

              <div class="d-flex align-items-center mt-4">
                <i class="bi bi-check2"></i>
                <h4>Transparent Reward Structure</h4>
              </div>
              <p>Our transparent reward structure ensures you know exactly what to expect. We provide clear information on potential returns and fees, so you can make informed decisions about your Funds.</p>

            </div><!-- End Tab 2 Content -->

            <div class="tab-pane fade" id="Staking">

              <p class="fst-italic">Our seasoned fund managers work diligently to optimize your investments, driving consistent growth while minimizing risks.
                We handle the complexities of the market so you can achieve your financial goals with peace of mind.</p>

              <div class="d-flex align-items-center mt-4">
                <i class="bi bi-check2"></i>
                <h4>Stable Passive Income</h4>
              </div>
              <p>Our staking services allow you to earn steady, passive income on your investments. By staking your assets, you can generate rewards without the need for constant trading or market timing.
              </p>

              <div class="d-flex align-items-center mt-4">
                <i class="bi bi-check2"></i>
                <h4>Secure Staking Environment</h4>
              </div>
              <p>We prioritize the security of your assets in our staking program. Utilizing advanced technology and security protocols, we ensure that your investments remain safe while earning rewards.
              </p>

              <div class="d-flex align-items-center mt-4">
                <i class="bi bi-check2"></i>
                <h4>User-Friendly Staking Process</h4>
              </div>
              <p>Our intuitive platform makes staking easy for everyone, from beginners to experienced investors. With simple steps and clear instructions, you can start earning rewards in no time.
              </p>

              <div class="d-flex align-items-center mt-4">
                <i class="bi bi-check2"></i>
                <h4>Staking Options</h4>
              </div>
              <p>At this time, we exclusively offer USDT staking. This approach allows you to focus on assets that match your investment strategy and risk preferences.</p>

              <div class="d-flex align-items-center mt-4">
                <i class="bi bi-check2"></i>
                <h4>Transparent Reward Structure</h4>
              </div>
              <p>Our transparent reward structure ensures you know exactly what to expect. We provide clear information on potential returns, fees, and lock-up periods, so you can make informed decisions about your staking investments.
              </p>

            </div><!-- End Tab 3 Content -->

          </div>

        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

  </section><!-- /About Section -->



  <!-- Call To Action Section -->
  <section id="call-to-action" class="call-to-action section">

    <div class="container" data-aos="zoom-out">

      <div class="row g-5">

        <div class="col-lg-8 col-md-6 content d-flex flex-column justify-content-center order-last order-md-first">
