          <p>At our company, we specialize in strategic investments across a wide array of sectors, including established businesses, innovative startups, e-commerce, stocks, cryptocurrencies, artificial intelligence, IT solutions, and even gold mining ventures. Our expert team meticulously curates a diversified portfolio designed to maximize returns while minimizing risk, ensuring that you can achieve your financial goals with confidence. Whether you’re looking to grow your wealth or explore new avenues for passive income, we provide the tailored strategies and insights you need to succeed.</p>
          <a class="cta-btn align-self-start" href="/signup">Start Your Journey</a>
        </div>

        <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6 order-first order-md-last d-flex align-items-center">
          <div class="img">
            <img src="<%= asset_path "img/cta.jpg" %>" alt="" class="img-fluid">
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

  </section><!-- /Call To Action Section -->

